{"t":567,"text":" The Secret of Willow"}
{"t":601,"text":" Pond\n\nEvery morning"}
{"t":634,"text":" before school, Nora walked"}
{"t":669,"text":" to Willow Pond to"}
{"t":701,"text":" feed the ducks. She"}
{"t":734,"text":" carried a small paper bag"}
{"t":767,"text":" of oats and a notebook"}
{"t":801,"text":", because Nora loved to"}
{"t":835,"text":" draw. One cold T"}
{"t":868,"text":"uesday in October, she no"}
{"t":901,"text":"ticed something strange. The "}
{"t":934,"text":"ducks were gathered at the"}
{"t":968,"text":" far edge of the pond,"}
{"t":1001,"text":" and none of them came to eat"}
{"t":1035,"text":".\n\n\"What's wrong"}
{"t":1068,"text":" with you today?\" Nora"}
{"t":1102,"text":" asked. The ducks only"}
{"t":1135,"text":" quacked and stared at the"}
{"t":1170,"text":" reeds.\n\nNora"}
{"t":1202,"text":" put down her bag and crept"}
{"t":1235,"text":" closer. Between the tall"}
{"t":1271,"text":", brown reeds she he"}
{"t":1302,"text":"ard a thin, shaky"}
{"t":1335,"text":" sound: _"}
{"t":1369,"text":"peep, peep, peep"}
{"t":1402,"text":"._"}
{"t":1437,"text":" A tiny duckling"}
{"t":1469,"text":" was tangled in a piece"}
{"t":1502,"text":" of old fishing line. It"}
{"t":1535,"text":" was shivering, and each time"}
{"t":1569,"text":" it tried to swim, the"}
{"t":1602,"text":" line pulled tighter."}
{"t":1636,"text":"\n\nNora's heart ra"}
{"t":1670,"text":"ced. She wanted to r"}
{"t":1703,"text":"ush in and grab it, but"}
{"t":1736,"text":" she remembered what her grand"}
{"t":1769,"text":"father always said: \"Sl"}
{"t":1802,"text":"ow hands help best.\" She took"}
{"t":1836,"text":" off her shoes, rol"}
{"t":1877,"text":"led up her jeans, and"}
{"t":1903,"text":" stepped into the icy water"}
{"t":1936,"text":". Gently, she lif"}
{"t":1969,"text":"ted the duckling and held it"}
{"t":2003,"text":" against her coat. With the"}
{"t":2036,"text":" tiny blade of her p"}
{"t":2070,"text":"encil sharpener, she"}
{"t":2103,"text":" carefully cut the line,"}
{"t":2136,"text":" one thread at a time."}
{"t":2170,"text":"\n\nWhen the duckling was free,"}
{"t":2203,"text":" it gave a happy peep"}
{"t":2236,"text":" and paddled back to its m"}
{"t":2270,"text":"other. The other ducks sw"}
{"t":2303,"text":"armed around it, quac"}
{"t":2336,"text":"king loudly, as if they"}
{"t":2370,"text":" were cheering.\n\nN"}
{"t":2404,"text":"ora was late for school, and her"}
{"t":2438,"text":" socks were soaked. But"}
{"t":2470,"text":" when her teacher asked why"}
{"t":2503,"text":", Nora only smiled"}
{"t":2537,"text":" and opened her notebook."}
{"t":2570,"text":" On the page was a drawing"}
{"t":2603,"text":" of a small duckling, and"}
{"t":2655,"text":" be"}
{"t":2672,"text":"neath it she had written: \""}
{"t":2704,"text":"Today, patience was braver"}
{"t":2737,"text":" than hurry.\"\n\n="}
